        "About six generated widths per photograph, not twelve",
        "A sizes attribute that matches the real layout at every breakpoint",
        "Mobile crops chosen by a human for hero and key images",
        "Quality settings tuned per format, checked by eye on a real screen",
        "No image served larger than it can possibly be displayed",
